        "text": "=Classify this cloud cost question as 'simple' or 'complex'.\n\nSimple = direct lookup, one metric, one time period, one cloud, dataset discovery\nComplex = trend comparison, month-over-month, root cause, multi-cloud breakdown, projections, multi-step\n\nQuestion: {{ $('Extract Input').first().json.chatInput }}\n\nReply with ONE word only: simple or complex",
